@{var tone=ViewData["Tone"]?.ToString()??"info";var title=ViewData["AlertTitle"]?.ToString()??"Informação";var message=ViewData["Message"]?.ToString()??"Consulte os detalhes antes de continuar.";var recommendation=ViewData["Recommendation"]?.ToString();}<div class="atlas-alert atlas-alert-@tone" role="status"><app-icon name="@(ViewData["Icon"]?.ToString()??"info")" size="21" decorative="true"/><div class="atlas-alert__content"><strong>@title</strong><p>@message</p>@if(recommendation is not null){<small><b>Ação recomendada:</b> @recommendation</small>}</div></div>
